+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. It was chosen for its memory-hard and time-hard properties, which give it stronger resistance to GPU-accelerated password cracking. This decision was recorded on 2026-09-26.
